'''Crazed Lizard Cat''' (狂乱のネコトカゲ, ''Kyōran no Neko Tokage'', '''Frenzy Lizard Cat''') is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy that first appears in [[Mammals? (Insane)|Mammals?]], where it can be unlocked as a [[Crazed Lizard Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Cat Unit]]. It was added in [[Version 2.2 Update#Version 2.2.3 Update|Version 2.2.3]].

