==Enemy==
This enemy has very long range and a decent amount of health. To make matters worse, its [[Mammals? (Insane)|Debut Stage]] spawns multiple of them, meaning that they can rack up relatively high amounts of DPS on your units. However, its damage is quite low and its high knockback count allows it to be kept at bay quite easily.

